          {
            "title": "Question: Catch all",
            "id": 77840,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang terjadi saat <code>common_friends</code> memiliki nilai yang lebih kecil dari 3?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"common_friends = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" common_friends &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Friend suggestions: Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No new suggestions&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"No new suggestions\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Blok kode dalam pernyataan <code>else</code> dijalankan</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Blok kode pada pernyataan <code>if</code> dijalankan</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Baik blok <code>if</code> maupun blok kode pada pernyataan <code>else</code> tidak dijalankan</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Blok kode dalam pernyataan <code>else</code> dijalankan.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nilai <code>common_friends</code> mana yang menampilkan <code>Friend suggestions: Sue</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"common_friends = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" common_friends &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Friend suggestions: Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No new suggestions&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"No new suggestions\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code> dan angka berapa pun di atasnya</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Angka berapa pun di atas <code>3</code>, tapi bukan <code>3</code> itu sendiri</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Angka berapa pun di bawah <code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>3</code> dan angka berapa pun di atasnya.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Lights on",
            "id": 77855,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pilih nilai untuk <code>mad_meter</code> agar blok <code>else</code> dijalankan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"mad_meter = \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mad_scientist = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dexter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mad_meter &gt;= \" /><text value=\"134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Madness achieved!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sorry, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + mad_scientist + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, not mad enough&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"134\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Sorry, Dexter, not mad enough\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>79</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Siapkan pemeriksaan pada <code>mad_meter</code> dan pilih nilainya agar kondisi <strong>tidak</strong> terpenuhi dan kode menampilkan <code>Sorry, Dexter, not mad enough</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"mad_meter = \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mad_scientist = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dexter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mad_meter &gt;= \" /><text value=\"134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Madness achieved!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sorry, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + mad_scientist + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, not mad enough&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"134\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Sorry, Dexter, not mad enough\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>79</code>, diikuti oleh <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
