          {
            "title": "Example: Adding elif",
            "id": 78600,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat kode kondisi <code>elif</code> untuk menampilkan <code>Gracias</code> jika <code>language</code> adalah <code>\"Spanish\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"language = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spanish&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" language == \" /><text value=\"&quot;English&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Thank you&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" language == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spanish&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gracias&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" language == \" /><text value=\"&quot;German&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Danke&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(message)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Gracias&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Gracias\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>elif</code>, diikuti oleh <code>language</code>, lalu <code>==</code>, <code>\"Spanish\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat cabang tengah, termasuk kondisi dan pesannya, agar kode menampilkan <code>Gracias</code> saat <code>language</code> sama dengan <code>\"Spanish\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"language = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spanish&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" language == \" /><text value=\"&quot;English&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Thank you&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" language == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spanish&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gracias&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" language == \" /><text value=\"&quot;German&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Danke&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(message)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"134\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;German&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Danke&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Gracias\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>elif</code>, diikuti oleh <code>language</code>, <code>==</code>, <code>\"Spanish\"</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"Gracias\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
