            "id": 80470,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Operator mana yang kita gunakan saat ingin menjalankan kode hanya ketika semua kondisi bernilai <code>True</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>and</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>or</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>not</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>and</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hadiah memerlukan tiket dan keanggotaan, tetapi <code>has_ticket or is_member</code> memberikannya hanya dengan keanggotaan.</p><p>Perubahan mana yang membuat kondisi mewajibkan keduanya?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ganti <code>or</code> dengan <code>and</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tukar <code>has_ticket</code> dan <code>is_member</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Gunakan hanya <code>is_member</code> sebagai kondisi.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ganti <code>or</code> dengan <code>and</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: As many as we want",
            "id": 80487,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mulailah dengan memeriksa apakah <code>like_author</code> adalah <code>True</code>, lalu gunakan <code>or</code> untuk memeriksa <code>like_genre</code>, dan terakhir <code>got_recommendation</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"like_author = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"like_genre = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"got_recommendation = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_author \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_genre \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" got_recommendation:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Buy book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"and\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Buy book\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>like_author</code>, diikuti oleh <code>or</code>, lalu <code>like_genre</code>, <code>or</code>, <code>got_recommendation</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Beli buku saat alasan mana pun true, apa pun value ketiga variabel, agar proses ini mencetak <code>Buy book</code>.</p><p>Periksa <code>like_author</code>, lalu <code>like_genre</code>, lalu <code>got_recommendation</code>, sesuai urutan tersebut.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"like_author = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"like_genre = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"got_recommendation = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_author \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_genre \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" got_recommendation:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Buy book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"and\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"not\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Buy book\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>like_author</code>, diikuti oleh <code>or</code>, <code>like_genre</code>, <code>or</code>, dan terakhir <code>got_recommendation</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
